Applicability of Existing Laws. The provisions of
the following shall continue to be applicable:
Executive Order No. 292 dated July 26, 1987 or the Revised
Administrative Code of 1987;
Presidential Decree No. 1594;
Republic Act No. 6957, as amended by Republic Act No.
7718, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations;
Executive Order No. 301 dated July 26, 1987; and
Executive Order No. 40 dated October 8, 2001 and its
Implementing Rules and Regulations.
